1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 98th generation. 566 to 640. 2nd son of Ruo (若). 
2 CONT
2 CONT A Scholar (学士) and Censor of Qingqian (青钱御史) during the Sui-Tang (随唐) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Chen (陈氏) and had 2 sons - Yan (芫) and Fang (芳).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 九十八世。公元566 - 公元640。若之次子, 芳之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 随唐时为青钱御史。配陈氏, 生二子 - 芫, 芳。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT SOURCES (资料来源) -
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Wen Ming Zu Jia Pu (文明祖家谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Huang Shi Ying Zuo Fang Yuan Qu Wu Hao Zhi Pu (黄氏英佐房园趣无号支谱).
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. 黄元方 - 百度百科.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. 黄正瑞的博客.
