1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Chén Liè's 陳烈 [Lèik] brothers Chén Hàn 陳漢 [Hön], Chén Lóng 陳隆 [Lũng], and Chén Yì 陳繹 [Yèik] formed a Social Alliance in Dōngxùbǐng 東旭炳 [Üng Gūk Bēin]  to support  Zōngrén 宗仁 [Düng Ngĩn] and Zōngjiā 宗嘉 [Düng Gä] bec
2 CONC ause the latter two were good officials. Chén Liè 陳烈 [Lèik] lived in Fúzhōu 福州 [Fūk Jiü] because he did not want to get involved with his brothers after they refused to listen to his reasoning. Together with his cousins he travele
2 CONC d to Jīnzhōu 金州 [Gïm Jiü]. Chén Liè 陳烈 [Lèik] had one son, named Guī 圭 [Gï].
2 CONT
2 CONT 阳春春城陈氏族谱（谟祖） http://bbs.chens.org.cn/fengtai/show.aspx?&id=563&cid=15
2 CONT
2 CONT 颍川陈氏宗谱台山陈法世系 http://bbs.chens.org.cn/fengtai/show.aspx?&id=613&cid=15
2 CONT
