1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 108th generation. 989 to 1067. 4th son of Shu (纾). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Refused officialdom and lived as a recluse (隐居不仕) during the Northern Song (北宋) Dynasty. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married Madam Wu (吴氏) and had 3 sons - Kao (考), Xiao (孝) and Chang (昌).
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 108世。公元989 - 公元1067。黄纾之四子, 黄昌之父。
2 CONT
2 CONT 北宋时隐居不仕。配吴氏, 生三子 - 考, 孝, 昌。
2 CONT
