1 NAME 裔昌/從善/天祥
1 NAME Chén Tiānxiáng 裔昌/從善/天祥 settled 東山, 台山 128,120,87,40,4,1G
1 NAME 天祥 /陈/ 128,120,87,40,5世
2 GIVN 天祥
2 SURN 陈
2 NSFX 128,120,87,40,5世
1 NAME 陈天祥, 128,120,87,40,5世
1 SEX M
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Tiān Xiáng established the 上閣東山台山縣 (Shangge, Dongshan, Taishan County, Guangdong, China) branch of the family.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Note on Generation Numbers (128, 120, 87, 5世)'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Tiān Xiáng is a 128th generation descendant of Huang Di (the Yellow Emperor) (2,697-2,597 BC), and following the patrilineal line of descent:
2 CONT * a 120th generation descendant of Gui Shun Di, 媯舜帝, 9,1G (2,305-2,205 BC)
2 CONT * a   87th generation descendant of Chén Hú Gōng 陳胡公, 42, 34,1G the first ruler of the Chen Kingdom
2 CONT * a     5th generation descendant of Chén Xuān 陳宣 (1174-1256) who established the 石頭新會 (Stone Village, Xin Hui, Guangdong, China) branch of the family
