2 CONT 斗祥 Ēo Tẽng (Dǒuxiáng) was the second son of 必恩 Bēik Yïn. He married a woman from the Fũng 馮 (Féng) family. His tomb was in Tëin Lũng Sān Ēng 青龍山巔 (Qīnglóngshāndiān). His son, 子昌 Dū Chëng, [was given by his older brother 斗秀 Ēo Xiü.
2 CONC ]
