1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 129th generation. 1603 to 1657. Eldest son of Ru Chun (Jyu Seon) (儒淳). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Chen (Can Si) (陈氏). Had 2 sons - Wei Lun (Wai Leon) (维纶) and Wei Ping (Wai Ping) (维屏-諱).
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the late Ming (Ming Hau Kei) (明后期) and early Qing (Cing Co) (清初) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 129世。公元1603 - 公元1657。儒淳公之长子也。諱耀德。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣陈氏, 生子二人曰, 维纶, 维屏。
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
