1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 130th generation. 1638 to 1704. 2nd and youngest son of Yao De (Jiu Dak) (燿德). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife was Madam Zhu (Zyu Si) (朱氏). Had 4 sons - Chun Bo (Ceon Paak) (春柏), Chun Song (Ceon Cung) (春松-諱), Chun Can (Ceon Can) (春灿) and Chun Xiu (Ceon Sau) (春秀). 
2 CONT
2 CONT Lived during the end-Ming (Ming Mut) (明末) and early Qing (Cing Co) (清初) period.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT 130世。公元1638 - 公元1704。耀德公之幼子。諱维屏。
2 CONT
2 CONT 妣朱氏, 生子四人曰, 春柏, 春松, 春灿, 春秀。
